"""Alert & Operational Visibility Tests — Phase 20.

Tests the Phase 20 alert and operational visibility pipeline:

    Fault (Phase 17)
        ↓
    Alert (Phase 20)
        ↓
    Alert lifecycle (OPEN → ACKNOWLEDGED → RESOLVED → CLOSED)
        ↓
    Operational Visibility (read-only summary)

All fixtures are synthetic/in-memory. No live Kubernetes connection.
No real provider mutation. No recovery/operation execution from visibility.

Test categories:
    - Alert Model
    - Fault → Alert conversion
    - Alert deduplication
    - Alert lifecycle
    - Alert resolution
    - Operational summary
    - Health / Resource / Fault / Operation visibility
    - Read-only safety
    - Graph context
    - Evidence policy
    - No inference policy
    - Kubernetes path
    - Cross-platform alert contract
    - Mutation safety
"""
